node_modules
.next
out
build
.DS_Store
*.pem

# Secrets. The old rules were `.env` + `.env*.local`, which left real gaps:
# `.env.production`, `.env.development` and — the one that actually happened —
# `.env.local.bak` were all UNIGNORED, so a `git add -A` would have committed
# a file containing every key. `.env.*` covers every suffix and every backup
# of one; .env.example is the documented template and is re-included below.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editor / tooling backups and merge leftovers. Same reasoning: these are
# copies of real files, so they carry whatever the original held.
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*~

# Firebase CLI working state (deploy cache, emulator data, debug logs).
.firebase
firebase-debug.log
firestore-debug.log
ui-debug.log

*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
*.docx
